     mark too many. Scoped to the menu, because the panels that fold away -
     the line editor, the record of what was sent - want their triangle.
     Both spellings, because Safari still wants its own. */
  [data-menu] > summary {
    list-style: none;
  }
  [data-menu] > summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  /* One row in the menu, whether it is a link, a submit or a tick. Written
